//@version=6
// ============================================================================
// GVLiveV2 FGF: XAUUSD 240m
// STATUS: CALIBRATED FOR THIS PAIR AND TIMEFRAME (rule v3.1 hold-out passed)
// READ FIRST: the FRAGILITY lines below say where this result comes from.
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Same code as GVLiveV2_Polymarket_PreCandle_Strategy_FGF.pine (the master
// file). Only this record, the strategy title and the input defaults listed
// below differ. Record date 2026-10-25, rule v3.1.
//
// FRAGILITY
//  - OANDA XAUUSD: without the 10 biggest trades +10.3R (halves +11.2 /
//    -0.9), without the 10 best entry days +10.3R; cost break-even $6.03
//    extra per round trip; TradingView's own report shows +90.5R because the
//    file's strategy() properties have commission 0 and slippage 0 (no costs
//    at all).
//  - VANTAGE XAUUSD: without the 10 biggest trades +33.8R (halves +51.4 /
//    -17.6), without the 10 best entry days +33.8R; cost break-even $4.37
//    extra per round trip; TradingView's own report shows +117.2R because the
//    file's strategy() properties have commission 0 and slippage 0 (no costs
//    at all).
//
// DATA AND COSTS
//  - OANDA XAUUSD 240m: 2,206 bars, 2025-05-13 to 2026-10-14 (17.0 months)
//  - VANTAGE XAUUSD 240m: 2,900 bars, 2025-01-01 to 2026-10-23 (21.7 months)
//  The OANDA data (2025-05-13 to 2026-10-14) lies inside the VANTAGE data
//    (2025-01-01 to 2026-10-23); VANTAGE 2025-01-01 to 2025-05-13 and
//    2026-10-14 to 2026-10-23 are not covered by OANDA. The halves are not
//    calendar-disjoint: OANDA's halves split at 2026-01-28, VANTAGE's at
//    2025-11-26, so part of the months used to select on one dataset are
//    scored on the other; the hold-out lines below therefore overstate the
//    out-of-sample evidence.
//  Costs: $0.30 spread per round trip, no commission, no slippage. Stop first
//    when a bar touches both stop and target. R = the stop distance.
//  Python replica of this script, swept over every setting of its input grid:
//    OANDA XAUUSD 1,045,854 after cleaning (dropped 307,296 settings whose
//    trail activation lies at or beyond the target and 43,650 with no exit
//    rule); VANTAGE XAUUSD 939,348 after cleaning (dropped 265,392 settings
//    whose trail activation lies at or beyond the target and 10,476 with no
//    exit rule). 730,944 settings exist in every dataset; 210,044 have
//    distinct results.
//
// RULE v3.1 (the same for every pair and timeframe)
//  Candidates: at least 8 trades and a positive result in both halves of
//    every dataset above. Pick: among the 40 best by worst half, the best by
//    0.5 x worst half + 0.5 x the mean worst half of its clone-free grid
//    neighbours (at least 5 neighbours with a positive mean). The pick is
//    adopted only if (1) selecting on the first halves works on the second
//    halves: the 40 best are at least 60% positive with a positive mean, the
//    mean beats 95% of random 40-setting draws from the same pool, and the 40
//    counted as their distinct entry-overlap clusters also beat random draws
//    of that size; (2) the same two tests pass with the halves swapped; (3)
//    the pick stays positive on every dataset under stressed costs. Otherwise
//    the strategy's general set is used only if it is positive in both halves
//    of every dataset with PF >= 1.10, positive under stressed costs and on a
//    plateau in this timeframe's grid; otherwise no file is published for the
//    timeframe.
//
// THIS TIMEFRAME
//  29,572 candidates.
//  Forward (select on first halves): the 40 best settings by the selection
//    half average +18.7R on the other half, 65% positive; settings from the
//    same pool average +5.0R (66% positive) and 95% of random 40-setting
//    draws stay below +8.9R. Counted as their 7 distinct entry-overlap
//    clusters, the representatives average +34.4R against a 95th percentile
//    of +14.6R for random 7-setting draws. PASSED.
//  Reverse (select on second halves): the 40 best settings by the selection
//    half average +40.1R on the other half, 97% positive; settings from the
//    same pool average +6.6R (62% positive) and 95% of random 40-setting
//    draws stay below +10.9R. Counted as their 5 distinct entry-overlap
//    clusters, the representatives average +44.7R against a 95th percentile
//    of +19.8R for random 5-setting draws. PASSED.
//  Stress test of the pick: PASSED.
//  DECISION: the per-timeframe pick is the default set in this file.
//
// THE DEFAULTS IN THIS FILE (S2 unit: ATR)
//    EMA 5 / 13, trend EMA 100, RSI filter on, pre-candle Market Next Candle,
//    radar Chart, min vol score 0, vol rise 0, close location 0.75, trend
//    direction off, SL 0.5 x ATR(14), no target, trail: activate at 4 ATR of
//    profit, distance 0.2 ATR, no time stop, no $ daily lock, max 3 losing
//    trades per day (Pine default, kept), direction filter off
//    OANDA XAUUSD: +86.2R, 219 trades, PF 1.46, win 16%, max DD 20.9R, halves
//      +41.6 / +44.7, thirds +20.7 / +24.0 / +41.5, 12 of 18 months positive,
//      best 2 months = 54% of the total, worst month -13.2R, longest losing
//      streak 20 trades
//    VANTAGE XAUUSD: +109.7R, 340 trades, PF 1.37, win 16%, max DD 30.2R,
//      halves +59.0 / +50.7, thirds +44.8 / +61.7 / +3.1, 11 of 22 months
//      positive, best 2 months = 54% of the total, worst month -12.8R,
//      longest losing streak 20 trades
//    OANDA XAUUSD: spread $0.50 + 1 tick/side +83.3R (halves +39.8 / +43.5);
//      spread $1.00 + 1 tick/side +76.2R; break-even extra cost $6.03 per
//      round trip on top of the $0.30 spread; with the 3-losing-trades daily
//      lock OFF +86.2R (219 trades); with the direction filter ON (OANDA
//      export columns) +23.3R, 107 trades, PF 1.25
//    VANTAGE XAUUSD: spread $0.50 + 1 tick/side +104.2R (halves +55.6 /
//      +48.5); spread $1.00 + 1 tick/side +91.6R; break-even extra cost $4.37
//      per round trip on top of the $0.30 spread; with the 3-losing-trades
//      daily lock OFF +109.7R (340 trades)
//    OANDA XAUUSD: 5% of the trades (+15.6R) come from the EMA-cross entry.
//      That entry is not limited to closed bars while the script calculates
//      on every tick, so live it can fire mid-bar; the backtest fills it at
//      the bar close.
//    VANTAGE XAUUSD: 6% of the trades (+19.5R) come from the EMA-cross entry.
//      That entry is not limited to closed bars while the script calculates
//      on every tick, so live it can fire mid-bar; the backtest fills it at
//      the bar close.
//    Plateau: worst half +41.6R; 10 clone-free grid neighbours, mean worst
//    half +11.9R, 70% of them positive in every half; two steps out 58
//    settings, 47% positive in every half, mean worst half -3.2R.
//
// OTHER INPUT SETS ON THE SAME DATA
//  Master-file hourly defaults: OANDA XAUUSD +48.3R (82 trades, PF 1.79),
//    VANTAGE XAUUSD +37.4R (117 trades, PF 1.41)
//  All-timeframe profile: OANDA XAUUSD +35.6R (49 trades, PF 2.03), VANTAGE
//    XAUUSD +39.6R (62 trades, PF 1.88)
//
// CAVEATS
//  Every result above is from the full dataset the rule saw, so it is
//    in-sample; the hold-out lines are the honest guide to what selection
//    delivers out of sample. Not modelled: the Max Quantity and margin caps
//    in R results (see S3 SIZING where given), Polymarket settlement.
//    Re-check with Bar Magnifier and on new data before trading live.
//  The trail is modelled pessimistically (an exit at activation minus the
//    distance on the bar that reaches the activation level); TradingView's
//    OHLC path can book these exits better, so its backtest may show more
//    than the figures above while live fills will be closer to them.
// ============================================================================
strategy("GVLiveV2 FGF | XAUUSD 240m (calibrated)", shorttitle="GV2 XAU 240m", overlay=true, initial_capital=100000, default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1, commission_type=strategy.commission.percent, commission_value=0, slippage=0, calc_on_every_tick=true, calc_on_order_fills=true, process_orders_on_close=false, pyramiding=0, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_bars_back=500)

//==============================================================================
// Volatility Filter (DEVMA)
//==============================================================================
group_devma = "Volatility Filter (DEVMA)"
devLen = input.int(30, "Deviation Lookback", minval=10, group=group_devma)
fastVoVixLen = input.int(10, "Fast VoVix Length", minval=5, group=group_devma)
slowVoVixLen = input.int(30, "Slow VoVix Length", minval=15, group=group_devma)

//==============================================================================
// Directional Trend Logic
//==============================================================================
group_trend = "Directional Trend"
fastEmaLen = input.int(5, "Fast EMA", group=group_trend, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
slowEmaLen = input.int(13, "Slow EMA", group=group_trend, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
trendFilterLen = input.int(100, "Trend Filter EMA", group=group_trend, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")

//==============================================================================
// Momentum Filter
//==============================================================================
group_mom = "Momentum Filter"
useRsiFilter = input.bool(true, "Use RSI Filter", group=group_mom, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
rsiLen = input.int(14, "RSI Length", group=group_mom)
rsiOverbought = input.int(70, "RSI Overbought", group=group_mom)
rsiOversold = input.int(30, "RSI Oversold", group=group_mom)

//==============================================================================
// Execution, Sizing, And Paper Bridge Settings
//==============================================================================
group_execution = "Execution And Sizing"
brokerPreset = input.string("Manual / custom", "Point-Value Preset", options=["Manual / custom", "Crypto 1 USD per qty"], group=group_execution, tooltip="Dollar value of a 1.00 price move for one quantity unit.")
manualPointValue = input.float(1.0, "Manual Point Value", minval=0.01, step=0.01, group=group_execution)

gS2 = "S2. Exits"
ExitMode       = input.string("ATR", "SL / TP / trail unit", options=["Points", "ATR"], group=gS2, tooltip="ATR (the tested mode). Points: fixed distances in points (mintick units); the Points defaults below are the ATR defaults converted with this timeframe's median ATR.")
slPoints       = input.float(1514, "Stop loss, pts (Points mode)", minval=0.0, step=1.0, group=gS2, tooltip="0.5 x the median ATR(14) of VANTAGE XAUUSD 240m ($30.27) in 0.01-tick points. On a 0.001-tick symbol (OANDA) multiply by 10.")
tpPoints       = input.float(0, "Take profit, pts (Points mode)", minval=0.0, step=1.0, group=gS2, tooltip="0 x the stop distance in points. 0 = no target.")
atrLen         = input.int(14, "ATR length (ATR mode)", minval=1, group=gS2)
slAtrMult      = input.float(0.5, "Stop loss, ATR mult (ATR mode)", minval=0.01, step=0.05, group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
tpR            = input.float(0.0, "Take profit, R multiple of SL (ATR mode)", minval=0.0, step=0.25, group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header). 0 = no target.")
useTrail       = input.bool(true, "Trailing stop", group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
trailActPoints = input.float(12110, "Trail activation, pts of profit (Points mode)", minval=0.0, step=1.0, group=gS2)
trailPoints    = input.float(605, "Trail distance, pts (Points mode)", minval=1.0, step=1.0, group=gS2)
trailActAtr    = input.float(4.0, "Trail activation, ATR mult (ATR mode)", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
trailDstAtr    = input.float(0.2, "Trail distance, ATR mult (ATR mode)", minval=0.005, step=0.005, group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
maxBarsHeld    = input.int(0, "Time stop, bars (0 = off)", minval=0, group=gS2, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header). 0 = off.")

gS3 = "S3. Sizing"
QtyMode    = input.string("Risk %", "Quantity", options=["Fixed", "Risk %"], group=gS3)
fixedQty   = input.float(10, "Fixed quantity (contracts = oz, 100 = 1 lot)", minval=0.0, group=gS3)
riskPct    = input.float(1.0, "Risk % of equity per trade (Risk mode)", minval=0.0, step=0.25, group=gS3, tooltip="Quantity = equity x risk% / (stop distance x point value). Needs a stop loss > 0.")
maxQty     = input.float(50, "Max quantity", minval=0.0, group=gS3)
qtyStep    = input.float(0.001, "Quantity step (rounds down)", minval=0.000001, group=gS3)
capMargin  = input.bool(true, "Cap quantity to available margin", group=gS3, tooltip="Quantity is also limited to equity / (price x point value x margin %), so an order never needs more margin than the account has.")
marginPct  = input.float(1.0, "Margin % (match Properties -> Margin)", minval=0.0, step=0.5, group=gS3)
riskPercent = riskPct

group_risk = "Paper Safety Layer"
useMaxBarsExit = input.bool(false, "Close If Still Open After N Bars", group=group_risk, tooltip="Off (the S2 time stop is the tested bar exit). Turn on only for Polymarket reset use.")
maxBarsInTrade = input.int(1, "Max Signal Bars In Trade", minval=1, group=group_risk, tooltip="This only resets the TradingView strategy position so another later window can signal. Polymarket paper exits are handled by market settlement.")
useDailyLossLock = input.bool(true, "Use Daily Loss Lock", group=group_risk)
maxDailyLossCurrency = input.float(0.0, "Max Daily Loss ($)", minval=0.0, step=10.0, group=group_risk, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header). 0 = off.")
maxDailyLosses = input.int(3, "Max Losing Trades Per Day", minval=1, group=group_risk)
useMaxStopDistance = input.bool(false, "Block Entries If ATR Stop Is Too Wide", group=group_risk)
maxStopDistancePoints = input.float(8.0, "Max Stop Distance In Price Points", minval=0.1, step=0.1, group=group_risk)
maxLiveSpreadPoints = input.float(0.50, "Max Live Spread Points For Bridge", minval=0.0, step=0.01, group=group_risk, tooltip="Included in JSON alerts for bridges that reject bad-spread orders.")

group_poly = "Polymarket Paper Router"
routerStrategyName = input.string("GVLiveV2_POLY_4H_FIRST_WINDOW", "Alert Strategy Name", group=group_poly)
seriesSlug = input.string("btc-up-or-down-5m", "Polymarket Series", options=["btc-up-or-down-5m", "doge-up-or-down-5m"], group=group_poly)
routerTimeframe = input.string("5", "Router Market Timeframe", group=group_poly, tooltip="Keep this at 5. The local paper router maps signals into 5-minute Polymarket Up/Down markets.")
requiredSignalTimeframe = input.string("240", "Required Signal Chart Timeframe", group=group_poly, tooltip="Only used when Allow Any Chart Timeframe is OFF. Keep 240 for the original 4H-only validation mode.")
allowAnyChartTimeframe = input.bool(true, "Allow Any Chart Timeframe", group=group_poly, tooltip="ON: run the strategy on any chart timeframe. OFF: only trade when the chart timeframe equals Required Signal Chart Timeframe.")
maxSignalSecondsAfterWindowStart = input.int(90, "Max Seconds After 5M Window Start", minval=0, maxval=299, group=group_poly)
oneSignalPerPolyWindow = input.bool(true, "Only One Signal Per 5M Window", group=group_poly)
paperStakeUsd = input.float(5.0, "Paper Stake USD", minval=0.01, step=0.01, group=group_poly)
sendEntryAlertsToWebhook = input.bool(true, "Send Entry Alerts To Webhook", group=group_poly)
sendExitAlertsToWebhook = input.bool(false, "Send Exit/Close Alerts To Webhook", group=group_poly, tooltip="Leave off for Polymarket settle mode. The router waits for the market result instead of using strategy exits.")
allowWeekendEntries = input.bool(true, "Allow Weekend Entries", group=group_poly, tooltip="This seconds-test variant defaults to 24/7 paper testing. Turn off to match the weekday-filtered validation exports.")

group_pre = "Pre-Candle Early Confirmation"
usePreCandleArm = input.bool(true, "Use Pre-Candle Arm", group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preCandleEntryMode = input.string("Market Next Candle", "Pre-Candle Entry Mode", options=["Signal Only", "Market Next Candle", "Stop Next Candle"], group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
radarTimeframeMode = input.string("Chart", "Radar Timeframe", options=["Auto", "Chart", "1", "3", "5", "15", "30", "60", "120", "240"], group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preMinScore = input.int(60, "Minimum Pre-Candle Score", minval=0, maxval=100, group=group_pre)
preMinVolScore = input.float(0.0, "Minimum Radar Vol Score", minval=0.0, maxval=100.0, step=1.0, group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preMinVolRise = input.float(0.0, "Minimum Radar Vol Rise", minval=0.0, step=0.5, group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preCloseLocation = input.float(0.75, "Close Location Pressure", minval=0.50, maxval=0.95, step=0.05, group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preUseTrend = input.bool(false, "Use Trend Direction", group=group_pre, tooltip="Calibrated for XAUUSD 240m (see the header).")
preUseEmaSlope = input.bool(false, "Use Radar EMA Slope", group=group_pre)
preUseRvol = input.bool(false, "Use Radar Relative Volume", group=group_pre)
preRvolLength = input.int(20, "Radar RVOL Length", minval=1, group=group_pre)
preMinRvol = input.float(1.10, "Minimum Radar RVOL", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=group_pre)
preUseBodyAtr = input.bool(false, "Use Radar Body/ATR Impulse", group=group_pre)
preMinBodyAtr = input.float(0.20, "Minimum Radar Body/ATR", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=group_pre)
preUseMicroBreak = input.bool(false, "Use Radar Micro-Breakout", group=group_pre)
preBreakoutLookback = input.int(2, "Radar Breakout Lookback", minval=1, maxval=20, group=group_pre)
preStopAtrBuffer = input.float(0.03, "Stop Next Candle ATR Buffer", minval=0.0, step=0.01, group=group_pre)
preCancelAfterBars = input.int(2, "Cancel Unfilled Pre-Stop After Bars", minval=1, maxval=10, group=group_pre)
showPreDebug = input.bool(true, "Show Pre-Candle Debug", group=group_pre)

group_data = "Training Data Capture"
collectTrainingData = input.bool(true, "Collect Entry Training Data", group=group_data)
includeTrainingDataInAlerts = input.bool(true, "Include Training Data In Entry Alerts", group=group_data)
plotTrainingData = input.bool(true, "Plot Export Fields In Data Window", group=group_data, tooltip="Use TradingView Export chart data, then filter rows where TD Entry Direction is 1 or -1.")
showTrainingLabels = input.bool(false, "Show Training Labels On Entry Bars", group=group_data)
trainingLabelHistory = input.int(60, "Training Label History", minval=1, maxval=300, group=group_data)

group_session = "New York Session"
useSessionFilter = input.bool(false, "Use NY Session Filter", group=group_session, tooltip="This seconds-test variant defaults to 24/7 paper testing. Turn on to match the session-filtered validation exports.")
tradePreset = input.string("Balanced", "Trade Preset", options=["Aggressive", "Balanced", "Conservative AM", "Custom"], group=group_session, tooltip="Balanced blocks the weak entry bars found in GVLive. Conservative AM trades the clean morning window only. Aggressive uses the full safe window.")
entry_session = input.session("0945-1530", "Custom/Aggressive Entry Session", group=group_session, tooltip="Used by Aggressive, Balanced, and Custom presets.")
morning_entry_session = input.session("0945-1115", "Conservative AM Entry Session", group=group_session)
flat_session = input.session("0930-1545", "Must Be Flat Outside This NY Session", group=group_session)

// ===================== BEGIN FLASHGOLD DIRECTION FILTER ======================
// Set true when this block lives in a script that runs in its own pane
// (overlay=false) so the visuals are drawn on the price chart.
FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY = false

GRP_FGF = "Direction filter"
fgfOn        = input.bool(false, "Enable filter", group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="Off (the tested setting). The header gives the result with the filter on, from the OANDA export columns.")
fgfTf        = input.timeframe("60", "Filter timeframe", group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="The FlashGold signal runs on this timeframe's candles, and any chart (or strategy) using the filter gets the answer that timeframe's own chart shows at that moment: 1 hour on a 1m chart = the 1H view. Only closed candles are read, so nothing repaints. 'Chart' = this chart's own candles.")
fgfLvMode    = input.string("Entry price", "Level", options=["Entry price", "Signal close"], group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="Entry price: the FlashGold entry price of the signal (ask + entry distance for a BUY, bid - entry distance for a SELL). Signal close: the close of the signal candle.")
fgfLast      = input.string("Until next signal", "Permission lasts", options=["Until next signal", "Minutes", "Candles"], group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="Until next signal: the level stays in force until the next signal replaces it. Minutes / Candles: it also ends after that many minutes, or that many filter-timeframe candles counted from the signal candle (1 = the signal candle only); then nothing is allowed until the next signal.")
fgfMinutes   = input.int(60, "Minutes", minval=1, group=GRP_FGF)
fgfBars      = input.int(1, "Candles", minval=1, group=GRP_FGF)
fgfCheck     = input.string("Tick", "Check price on", options=["Tick", "Candle open", "Candle close"], group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="When price is compared to the level. Tick: the live price, on every tick (closed candles keep their close). Candle open: each candle's open, decided on its first tick and fixed for the whole candle. Candle close: each candle's close, decided when it closes; while a candle is forming it is judged at its open with the last closed candle's close.")
fgfBandAtr   = input.float(0.25, "No-trade band, ATR mult", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="NO TRADE zone around the level: +- this many ATR(14) of the filter timeframe at the signal candle. Inside it price has not chosen a side, so neither buys nor sells are allowed. 0 = no band: above the level BUY ZONE, below it SELL ZONE.")
fgfAgainst   = input.bool(true, "Allow trading against the signal", group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="On: below a BUY signal's level the SELL ZONE allows sells (and above a SELL signal's level the BUY ZONE allows buys). Off: those zones are NO TRADE; only the signal's own direction is allowed, and only once price confirms it.")
fgfAllowBuy  = input.bool(true, "Allow buys", inline="side", group=GRP_FGF)
fgfAllowSell = input.bool(true, "Allow sells", inline="side", group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="Turn one side off completely.")
fgfShowBg    = input.bool(true, "Shade", inline="vis", group=GRP_FGF)
fgfShowLv    = input.bool(true, "Level line", inline="vis", group=GRP_FGF)
fgfSigMark   = input.bool(true, "Signal marks", inline="vis", group=GRP_FGF, tooltip="Shade: green = BUY ZONE (buys allowed), red = SELL ZONE (sells allowed), gray = NO TRADE (inside the band, against the signal when that is off, or that side turned off). Level line: the signal's level, dashed lines: the band edges, names of the zones at the last candle. Signal marks: a triangle where a signal becomes known.")
fgfShowTbl   = input.bool(true, "Status box", inline="tbl", group=GRP_FGF)
fgfTblPos    = input.string("top_right", "", options=["top_right","middle_right","bottom_right","top_left","middle_left","bottom_left","top_center","bottom_center"], inline="tbl", group=GRP_FGF)

GRP_FGS = "Direction score"
fgsShow = input.bool(false, "Show the direction score", group=GRP_FGS, tooltip="In the status box: how often each of three readings of the signals (level side, signal direction, signal reversed) was right on the filter timeframe's candles, 1 and H candles later, buys and sells averaged (50% = a coin flip). Information only: the zones never use it.")
fgsWin  = input.int(500, "Window, filter candles (0 = all history)", minval=0, maxval=500, group=GRP_FGS)
fgsH    = input.int(10, "Longer horizon H, filter candles", minval=2, maxval=100, group=GRP_FGS)

// ---- FlashGold signal inputs (the strategy's, same defaults) ----------------
GRP_FGC = "FlashGold signal: core"
fgfSpreadPts    = input.float(25.0, "Spread pts", minval=0.0, step=0.1, group=GRP_FGC, tooltip="Full spread in points (mintick units). Half of it offsets bid and ask.")
fgfEntryDistPts = input.float(50.0, "Entry distance pts (Points unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.1, group=GRP_FGC)
fgfHoldBars     = input.int(0, "Entry hold bars", minval=0, group=GRP_FGC)
fgfHoldFavPts   = input.float(5.0, "Hold min favorable pts (Points unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.1, group=GRP_FGC)
fgfOnePerBar    = input.bool(true, "One signal per bar", group=GRP_FGC)

GRP_FGB = "FlashGold signal: burst / direction"
fgfDistUnit     = input.string("ATR", "Burst / entry distance / hold unit", options=["ATR", "Points"], group=GRP_FGB, tooltip="ATR: the three thresholds below are multiples of ATR(14) of the filter timeframe. Points: the point inputs in the core group are used.")
fgfBurstAtr     = input.float(0.5, "Burst threshold, ATR mult (ATR unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=GRP_FGB)
fgfEntryDistAtr = input.float(0.25, "Entry distance, ATR mult (ATR unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=GRP_FGB)
fgfHoldFavAtr   = input.float(0.1, "Hold min favorable, ATR mult (ATR unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.05, group=GRP_FGB)
fgfBurstPts     = input.float(172.0, "Burst threshold pts (Points unit)", minval=0.0, step=0.1, group=GRP_FGB)
fgfUseBurst     = input.bool(true, "Require burst gate", group=GRP_FGB)
fgfAnyCombo     = input.bool(false, "Allow any combo", group=GRP_FGB, tooltip="If on, TDI parent/zone can approve direction even when burst is weaker.")
fgfDriftBars    = input.int(60, "Prior drift bars", minval=1, group=GRP_FGB)
fgfUseDrift     = input.bool(false, "Use prior drift filter", group=GRP_FGB)

GRP_FGZ = "FlashGold signal: TDI trade zone"
fgfUseZones   = input.bool(true, "Use TDI trade-zone filter", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfParentTf   = input.timeframe("60", "Parent obedience timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ, tooltip="Calibrated with the parent = the timeframe the signal runs on. Keep it equal to Filter timeframe: a parent above it reads its forming bar live, so it repaints.")
fgfRsiLen     = input.int(14, "TDI RSI length", minval=2, group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfFastLen    = input.int(2, "TDI white fast length", minval=1, group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfMinAligned = input.int(2, "Minimum child zones aligned", minval=0, maxval=6, group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfFlatParent = input.bool(false, "Allow trade if parent is flat", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfIgnoreNa   = input.bool(true, "Ignore zones without data", group=GRP_FGZ, tooltip="A child zone whose timeframe has no data on this candle is dropped from the active count instead of counting as MIX.")
fgfHtfClosed  = input.bool(true, "Higher-TF zones use the last CLOSED bar", group=GRP_FGZ, tooltip="A child zone on a timeframe HIGHER than the filter timeframe is read from its last closed bar, so history and live agree. Off: such a zone reads its forming bar live, so it repaints.")
fgfUseZ1 = input.bool(true, "Use child zone 1", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf1  = input.timeframe("60", "Zone 1 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfUseZ2 = input.bool(true, "Use child zone 2", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf2  = input.timeframe("120", "Zone 2 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfUseZ3 = input.bool(true, "Use child zone 3", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf3  = input.timeframe("240", "Zone 3 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfUseZ4 = input.bool(false, "Use child zone 4", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf4  = input.timeframe("480", "Zone 4 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfUseZ5 = input.bool(false, "Use child zone 5", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf5  = input.timeframe("1", "Zone 5 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfUseZ6 = input.bool(false, "Use child zone 6", group=GRP_FGZ)
fgfZTf6  = input.timeframe("2", "Zone 6 timeframe", group=GRP_FGZ)

// The timeframe the signal runs on ("Chart" = the chart's own).
string fgfTfEff = fgfTf == "" ? timeframe.period : fgfTf
int    fgfTfSec = timeframe.in_seconds(fgfTfEff)

// ===== FLASHGOLD SIGNAL =======================================================
// The strategy's signal logic, unchanged. It runs on the filter timeframe
// (ctxSec = its seconds, used where the strategy compared to the chart).

// TDI direction: fast line (SMA of RSI) rising = 1, falling = -1, flat = 0.
fgfTdiDir() =>
    float r = ta.rsi(close, fgfRsiLen)
    float f = ta.sma(r, fgfFastLen)
    f > f[1] ? 1 : f < f[1] ? -1 : 0

fgfTdiDirPrev() =>
    int d = fgfTdiDir()
    d[1]

// Direction of a child zone. A zone on a timeframe HIGHER than the one the
// signal runs on is read from its last closed bar (fgfHtfClosed).
fgfZoneDir(string tf, int ctxSec) =>
    int dNow  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, tf, fgfTdiDir(), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
    int dPrev = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, tf, fgfTdiDirPrev(), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_on)
    fgfHtfClosed and timeframe.in_seconds(tf) > ctxSec ? dPrev : dNow

fgfZoneOn(bool use, int dir) =>
    use and (not fgfIgnoreNa or not na(dir))

fgfAlign(int dir, bool on, int side) =>
    on and side != 0 and dir == side ? 1 : 0

// Returns [buy signal, sell signal, signal (entry) price, parent side,
// aligned zones, active zones].
fgfSignal(int ctxSec) =>
    // price model
    float pt         = syminfo.mintick
    float halfSpread = fgfSpreadPts * pt * 0.5
    float bidPx      = close - halfSpread
    float askPx      = close + halfSpread
    float midPrice   = (bidPx + askPx) * 0.5

    // TDI trade zone
    int parentDir = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, fgfParentTf, fgfTdiDir(), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
    int z1Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf1, ctxSec)
    int z2Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf2, ctxSec)
    int z3Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf3, ctxSec)
    int z4Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf4, ctxSec)
    int z5Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf5, ctxSec)
    int z6Dir = fgfZoneDir(fgfZTf6, ctxSec)

    bool on1 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ1, z1Dir)
    bool on2 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ2, z2Dir)
    bool on3 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ3, z3Dir)
    bool on4 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ4, z4Dir)
    bool on5 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ5, z5Dir)
    bool on6 = fgfZoneOn(fgfUseZ6, z6Dir)

    int activeZones  = (on1 ? 1 : 0) + (on2 ? 1 : 0) + (on3 ? 1 : 0) + (on4 ? 1 : 0) + (on5 ? 1 : 0) + (on6 ? 1 : 0)
    int parentSide   = parentDir > 0 ? 1 : parentDir < 0 ? -1 : 0
    int alignedZones = fgfAlign(z1Dir, on1, parentSide) + fgfAlign(z2Dir, on2, parentSide) + fgfAlign(z3Dir, on3, parentSide) + fgfAlign(z4Dir, on4, parentSide) + fgfAlign(z5Dir, on5, parentSide) + fgfAlign(z6Dir, on6, parentSide)

    int  requiredAligned   = math.min(fgfMinAligned, activeZones)
    bool parentFlatAllowed = fgfFlatParent and parentSide == 0
    bool zoneReady         = activeZones == 0 or alignedZones >= requiredAligned

    bool tradeZoneBuyAllowed  = not fgfUseZones or ((parentSide == 1 or parentFlatAllowed) and zoneReady)
    bool tradeZoneSellAllowed = not fgfUseZones or ((parentSide == -1 or parentFlatAllowed) and zoneReady)

    // burst / prior drift
    float atrPts       = ta.atr(14) / pt
    float burstThrPts  = fgfDistUnit == "ATR" ? fgfBurstAtr * atrPts : fgfBurstPts
    float entryDistPts = fgfDistUnit == "ATR" ? fgfEntryDistAtr * atrPts : fgfEntryDistPts
    float holdFavPts   = fgfDistUnit == "ATR" ? fgfHoldFavAtr * atrPts : fgfHoldFavPts

    float burstPts      = (midPrice - midPrice[1]) / pt
    float priorDriftPts = (midPrice - midPrice[fgfDriftBars]) / pt

    bool burstBuy  = burstPts >= burstThrPts
    bool burstSell = burstPts <= -burstThrPts

    bool priorBuyOk  = not fgfUseDrift or priorDriftPts > 0
    bool priorSellOk = not fgfUseDrift or priorDriftPts < 0

    bool rawBuyCandidate  = fgfAnyCombo ? (tradeZoneBuyAllowed and (not fgfUseBurst or burstBuy or parentSide == 1)) : (tradeZoneBuyAllowed and burstBuy)
    bool rawSellCandidate = fgfAnyCombo ? (tradeZoneSellAllowed and (not fgfUseBurst or burstSell or parentSide == -1)) : (tradeZoneSellAllowed and burstSell)

    bool buyCandidate  = rawBuyCandidate and priorBuyOk
    bool sellCandidate = rawSellCandidate and priorSellOk

    // entry hold / virtual stop
    var bool  holdActive    = false
    var bool  holdIsBuy     = false
    var int   holdSignalBar = na
    var float holdSignalMid = na
    var int   lastEntryBar  = na

    float buyEntryPrice  = na
    float sellEntryPrice = na
    bool  buySignal      = false
    bool  sellSignal     = false

    bool canFire = not fgfOnePerBar or na(lastEntryBar) or lastEntryBar != bar_index

    if buyCandidate and canFire
        if fgfHoldBars == 0
            buyEntryPrice := askPx + entryDistPts * pt
            buySignal     := true
            lastEntryBar  := bar_index
        else if not holdActive
            holdActive    := true
            holdIsBuy     := true
            holdSignalBar := bar_index
            holdSignalMid := midPrice
        else if holdIsBuy
            int   elapsedBars    = bar_index - holdSignalBar
            float holdMovePoints = (midPrice - holdSignalMid) / pt
            if elapsedBars >= fgfHoldBars and holdMovePoints >= holdFavPts
                buyEntryPrice := askPx + entryDistPts * pt
                buySignal     := true
                lastEntryBar  := bar_index
                holdActive    := false

    if sellCandidate and canFire
        if fgfHoldBars == 0
            sellEntryPrice := bidPx - entryDistPts * pt
            sellSignal     := true
            lastEntryBar   := bar_index
        else if not holdActive
            holdActive    := true
            holdIsBuy     := false
            holdSignalBar := bar_index
            holdSignalMid := midPrice
        else if not holdIsBuy
            int   elapsedBars    = bar_index - holdSignalBar
            float holdMovePoints = (holdSignalMid - midPrice) / pt
            if elapsedBars >= fgfHoldBars and holdMovePoints >= holdFavPts
                sellEntryPrice := bidPx - entryDistPts * pt
                sellSignal     := true
                lastEntryBar   := bar_index
                holdActive     := false

    if holdActive and ((holdIsBuy and not tradeZoneBuyAllowed) or (not holdIsBuy and not tradeZoneSellAllowed))
        holdActive    := false
        holdSignalBar := na
        holdSignalMid := na

    float signalPx = buySignal ? buyEntryPrice : sellSignal ? sellEntryPrice : na
    [buySignal, sellSignal, signalPx, parentSide, alignedZones, activeZones]
// ===== END FLASHGOLD SIGNAL ===================================================

// Arming, on the filter timeframe: a signal candle sets the level at its
// close. Committed state only (var), so backtests and live agree. aId counts
// the signals.
fgfArm(bool sBuy, bool sSell, float sPx, float sAtr) =>
    var int   aAt  = na
    var int   aBar = na
    var float aPx  = na
    var int   aDir = 0
    var int   aId  = 0
    var float aAtr = na
    if sBuy or sSell
        aAt  := nz(time_close, time)
        aBar := bar_index
        aPx  := fgfLvMode == "Entry price" ? nz(sPx, close) : close
        aDir := sBuy ? 1 : -1
        aId  += 1
        aAtr := sAtr
    [aAt, aBar, aPx, aDir, aId, aAtr]

// Direction score, on the filter timeframe: a rule's direction d at a candle
// is right h candles later when the close has moved that way. Returns the
// balanced share right (mean of the UP and DOWN shares; na until both
// exist) and the number of scored calls, over the window.
fgfHits(int d, int h) =>
    float mv   = close - close[h]
    int   pd   = nz(d[h])
    float upN  = pd == 1 and mv != 0 ? 1.0 : 0.0
    float upH  = pd == 1 and mv > 0 ? 1.0 : 0.0
    float dnN  = pd == -1 and mv != 0 ? 1.0 : 0.0
    float dnH  = pd == -1 and mv < 0 ? 1.0 : 0.0
    int   w    = math.max(fgsWin, 1)
    float wUpN = math.sum(upN, w)
    float wUpH = math.sum(upH, w)
    float wDnN = math.sum(dnN, w)
    float wDnH = math.sum(dnH, w)
    float cUpN = ta.cum(upN)
    float cUpH = ta.cum(upH)
    float cDnN = ta.cum(dnN)
    float cDnH = ta.cum(dnH)
    // (until the window is full: every candle so far)
    float sUpN = fgsWin > 0 and not na(wUpN) ? wUpN : cUpN
    float sUpH = fgsWin > 0 and not na(wUpH) ? wUpH : cUpH
    float sDnN = fgsWin > 0 and not na(wDnN) ? wDnN : cDnN
    float sDnH = fgsWin > 0 and not na(wDnH) ? wDnH : cDnH
    float acc  = sUpN > 0 and sDnN > 0 ? 0.5 * (sUpH / sUpN + sDnH / sDnN) : na
    [acc, sUpN + sDnN]

// The three rules at this filter candle's close, scored 1 and H candles later.
// (Level side: on the signal candle a close exactly AT the level counts as
// the signal's side, as the gate allows it there.)
fgfScore(float aPx, int aDir, int aBar) =>
    int dL = na(aPx) ? 0 : close > aPx ? 1 : close < aPx ? -1 : aBar == bar_index ? nz(aDir) : 0
    int dS = nz(aDir)
    int dR = -nz(aDir)
    [l1, ln] = fgfHits(dL, 1)
    [lh, lhn] = fgfHits(dL, fgsH)
    [s1, sn] = fgfHits(dS, 1)
    [sh, shn] = fgfHits(dS, fgsH)
    [r1, rn] = fgfHits(dR, 1)
    [rh, rhn] = fgfHits(dR, fgsH)
    [l1, lh, s1, sh, r1, rh, ln]

// Each filter candle sends its arm, its conditions, its index, open and close
// time, and the arm, conditions and close time of the candle before it. An
// arm is used only once the candle that made it has closed by this chart's
// clock, so the forming filter candle is never read and nothing repaints.
fgfRead() =>
    [sBuy, sSell, sPx, sPar, sAl, sAc] = fgfSignal(fgfTfSec)
    float fAtr = ta.atr(14)
    [aAt, aBar, aPx, aDir, aId, aAtr] = fgfArm(sBuy, sSell, sPx, fAtr)
    [cL1, cLh, cS1, cSh, cR1, cRh, cN] = fgfScore(aPx, aDir, aBar)
    [aAt, aBar, aPx, aDir, aId, sPar, sAl, sAc, bar_index, time, nz(time_close, time), aAt[1], aBar[1], aPx[1], aDir[1], aId[1], sPar[1], sAl[1], sAc[1], nz(time_close[1], time[1]), cL1, cLh, cS1, cSh, cR1, cRh, cN, cL1[1], cLh[1], cS1[1], cSh[1], cR1[1], cRh[1], cN[1], aAtr, aAtr[1]]

[fpAt, fpBar, fpPx, fpDir, fpId, fpPar, fpAl, fpAc, fpIdx, fpOpen, fpClose, fqAt, fqBar, fqPx, fqDir, fqId, fqPar, fqAl, fqAc, fqClose, fpL1, fpLh, fpS1, fpSh, fpR1, fpRh, fpN, fqL1, fqLh, fqS1, fqSh, fqR1, fqRh, fqN, fpAtr, fqAtr] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, fgfTfEff, fgfRead(), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)

fgfTfText(string tf) =>
    int sec = timeframe.in_seconds(tf)
    sec < 60 ? str.tostring(sec) + "s" : sec < 3600 ? str.tostring(sec / 60, "#.##") + "m" : sec < 86400 ? str.tostring(sec / 3600, "#.##") + "H" : tf
string fgfTfTag = fgfTfText(fgfTfEff)

// Clock: the moment a bar is judged ("Check price on").
//   Tick          a closed bar at its close time; the live bar at the real
//                 clock (every tick), kept inside the bar.
//   Candle open   every bar at its open time (fixed from its first tick).
//   Candle close  a closed bar at its close time; the live bar at its open
//                 time, with the last closed candle's close (see fgfValue).
// Closed bars never repaint in any mode.
bool fgfLiveBar = not barstate.isconfirmed
bool fgfAtOpen  = fgfCheck == "Candle open" or (fgfCheck == "Candle close" and fgfLiveBar)
// The close-time clock (Tick, and closed bars in Candle close). A live bar's
// real clock never reaches the bar's close, nor the close of the filter
// candle still forming (fp on a live bar), so a filter candle is never read
// before its data has closed (delayed data, late ticks).
int  fgfClockC  = fgfLiveBar ? math.max(time, math.min(timenow, nz(time_close, timenow + 1) - 1, nz(fpClose, timenow + 1) - 1)) : nz(time_close, time)
fgfClock = fgfAtOpen ? time : fgfClockC

// The arm in force = the latest filter candle closed by the clock:
//   1  the latest filter candle (fp), once it has closed by the clock
//   2  the candle before it (fq), once that one has closed
//   0  neither (a chart candle longer than the filter candle, judged at its
//      open): the previous chart bar's close-time pick, the latest filter
//      candle closed by this bar's open, as none closes between the two;
//      its index is judged at this bar's open (after a session gap, the
//      next candle)
int fgfSelC = fgfClockC >= fpClose ? 1 : 2
int fgfSel  = fgfAtOpen ? (fpClose <= time ? 1 : fqClose <= time ? 2 : 0) : fgfSelC
// the close-time pick of every bar, kept for the next bar's open (fgfSel 0)
int   fgfCAt  = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpAt  : fqAt
int   fgfCBar = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpBar : fqBar
float fgfCPx  = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpPx  : fqPx
int   fgfCDir = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpDir : fqDir
int   fgfCId  = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpId  : fqId
int   fgfCPar = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpPar : fqPar
int   fgfCAl  = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpAl  : fqAl
int   fgfCAc  = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpAc  : fqAc
// The filter candle the clock falls in (Candles mode): the picked candle when
// it closes exactly at the clock, else the one after it.
int   fgfCIdx = fgfSelC == 1 ? (fgfClockC == fpClose ? fpIdx : fpIdx + 1) : (fgfClockC == fqClose ? fpIdx - 1 : fpIdx)
// the picked candle itself and its close, for the next bar's open (fgfSel 0)
int   fgfCK      = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpIdx : fpIdx - 1
int   fgfCKClose = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpClose : fqClose

int   fgfSigAt  = fgfSel == 1 ? fpAt  : fgfSel == 2 ? fqAt  : fgfCAt[1]
int   fgfSigBar = fgfSel == 1 ? fpBar : fgfSel == 2 ? fqBar : fgfCBar[1]
float fgfLevel  = fgfSel == 1 ? fpPx  : fgfSel == 2 ? fqPx  : fgfCPx[1]
int   fgfSigDir = nz(fgfSel == 1 ? fpDir : fgfSel == 2 ? fqDir : fgfCDir[1])
// the ATR(14) of the signal candle (the no-trade band's unit)
float fgfCAtr   = fgfSelC == 1 ? fpAtr : fqAtr
float fgfSigAtr = fgfSel == 1 ? fpAtr : fgfSel == 2 ? fqAtr : fgfCAtr[1]
int   fgfSigId  = nz(fgfSel == 1 ? fpId  : fgfSel == 2 ? fqId  : fgfCId[1])
// The conditions of the last closed filter candle (status box).
int   fgfPar    = fgfSel == 1 ? fpPar : fgfSel == 2 ? fqPar : fgfCPar[1]
int   fgfAl     = fgfSel == 1 ? fpAl  : fgfSel == 2 ? fqAl  : fgfCAl[1]
int   fgfAc     = fgfSel == 1 ? fpAc  : fgfSel == 2 ? fqAc  : fgfCAc[1]
// The direction score of the last closed filter candle (status box, output).
fgfPickC(float p, float q) =>
    fgfSelC == 1 ? p : q
fgfPick(float p, float q, float cPrev) =>
    fgfSel == 1 ? p : fgfSel == 2 ? q : cPrev
float fgsCL1 = fgfPickC(fpL1, fqL1)
float fgsCLh = fgfPickC(fpLh, fqLh)
float fgsCS1 = fgfPickC(fpS1, fqS1)
float fgsCSh = fgfPickC(fpSh, fqSh)
float fgsCR1 = fgfPickC(fpR1, fqR1)
float fgsCRh = fgfPickC(fpRh, fqRh)
float fgsCN  = fgfPickC(fpN, fqN)
float fgsL1  = fgfPick(fpL1, fqL1, fgsCL1[1])
float fgsLh  = fgfPick(fpLh, fqLh, fgsCLh[1])
float fgsS1  = fgfPick(fpS1, fqS1, fgsCS1[1])
float fgsSh  = fgfPick(fpSh, fqSh, fgsCSh[1])
float fgsR1  = fgfPick(fpR1, fqR1, fgsCR1[1])
float fgsRh  = fgfPick(fpRh, fqRh, fgsCRh[1])
float fgsN   = fgfPick(fpN, fqN, fgsCN[1])
int   fgfIdx    = not fgfAtOpen ? fgfCIdx : fgfSel == 1 ? (time == fpClose ? fpIdx : fpIdx + 1) : fgfSel == 2 ? (time == fqClose ? fpIdx - 1 : fpIdx) : (time == fgfCKClose[1] ? fgfCK[1] : fgfCK[1] + 1)

// The price compared to the level, at that moment.
fgfValue = fgfCheck == "Candle open" ? open : fgfCheck == "Candle close" and fgfLiveBar ? close[1] : close

// Permission window: from the signal candle's close, until the next signal
// (or the minutes / candles run out).
bool fgfArmed  = not na(fgfSigAt) and fgfClock >= fgfSigAt
int  fgfEnd    = fgfLast == "Minutes" and fgfArmed ? fgfSigAt + fgfMinutes * 60000 : na
int  fgfEndBar = fgfLast == "Candles" and fgfArmed ? fgfSigBar + fgfBars : na
bool fgfOpen   = fgfArmed and (fgfLast == "Minutes" ? fgfClock < fgfEnd : fgfLast == "Candles" ? fgfIdx < fgfEndBar : true)

// On the signal candle itself price can sit exactly at the level ("Signal
// close"): there the signal's own side counts as allowed AT the level.
bool fgfOnSigBar = fgfArmed and fgfIdx == fgfSigBar
bool fgfAtBuyLv  = fgfOnSigBar and fgfSigDir > 0 and fgfValue >= fgfLevel
bool fgfAtSellLv = fgfOnSigBar and fgfSigDir < 0 and fgfValue <= fgfLevel

// The zones (see ZONES): above the band BUY ZONE, below it SELL ZONE, inside
// it NO TRADE. With no band the level itself splits them (and on the signal
// candle price exactly at the level counts for the signal's side).
float fgfBand  = fgfBandAtr * nz(fgfSigAtr)
float fgfMt    = syminfo.mintick
float fgfUpLv  = fgfBand > 0 ? math.ceil((fgfLevel + fgfBand) / fgfMt - 1e-9) * fgfMt : fgfLevel
float fgfDnLv  = fgfBand > 0 ? math.floor((fgfLevel - fgfBand) / fgfMt + 1e-9) * fgfMt : fgfLevel
bool  fgfInUp  = fgfBand > 0 ? fgfValue > fgfUpLv + fgfMt / 2 : (fgfValue > fgfLevel or fgfAtBuyLv)
bool  fgfInDn  = fgfBand > 0 ? fgfValue < fgfDnLv - fgfMt / 2 : (fgfValue < fgfLevel or fgfAtSellLv)
// the signal's direction is confirmed while price is in its own zone
bool  fgfSigOk = fgfArmed and (fgfSigDir > 0 ? fgfInUp : fgfSigDir < 0 ? fgfInDn : false)
// a zone allows its side unless it is against the signal and that is off
bool  fgfUpNow = fgfInUp and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir > 0)
bool  fgfDnNow = fgfInDn and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir < 0)

// Final gates: is a buy / a sell ALLOWED on this bar? (Permission only.)
fgfBuyOk  = not fgfOn or (fgfOpen and fgfAllowBuy  and fgfUpNow)
fgfSellOk = not fgfOn or (fgfOpen and fgfAllowSell and fgfDnNow)

// A new signal became known on this bar; a Minutes / Candles permission ended.
bool fgfNewSig  = fgfSigId > fgfSigId[1]
// What may be done now: 1 BUY ZONE, -1 SELL ZONE, 0 NO TRADE, 2 filter off.
int  fgfZone    = not fgfOn ? 2 : fgfBuyOk ? 1 : fgfSellOk ? -1 : 0
bool fgfEnded   = fgfArmed and not fgfOpen
bool fgfExpired = fgfOn and fgfEnded and not fgfEnded[1] and not barstate.isfirst

// ---- Visuals (optional: delete from here to END if you only want the gates)
fgfPosOf(string s) =>
    switch s
        "top_right"     => position.top_right
        "bottom_right"  => position.bottom_right
        "top_left"      => position.top_left
        "middle_left"   => position.middle_left
        "bottom_left"   => position.bottom_left
        "top_center"    => position.top_center
        "bottom_center" => position.bottom_center
        => position.middle_right

bgcolor(fgfShowBg and fgfOn and fgfOpen ? (fgfBuyOk ? color.new(color.green, 85) : fgfSellOk ? color.new(color.red, 85) : color.new(color.gray, 88)) : na, title="FGF permission", force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
plotshape(fgfSigMark and fgfOn and fgfNewSig and fgfSigDir > 0, "FGF buy signal",  shape.triangleup,   location.belowbar, color.lime, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
plotshape(fgfSigMark and fgfOn and fgfNewSig and fgfSigDir < 0, "FGF sell signal", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, color.red,  size=size.tiny, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
// GVLiveV2 fuse: the "FGF permission ended" mark is left out. GVLiveV2 already
// uses 61 of the 64 plots a script may have; the status box still shows
// when a Minutes / Candles permission has ended.

// Level line as a drawing (it does not stretch the price scale). Each signal
// keeps its own line and label, so past levels stay readable. Redrawn every
// bar so a host script's own drawings never garbage-collect the current one.
var line  fgfLn   = na
var label fgfLbl  = na
var int   fgfFrom = na
if fgfNewSig or (na(fgfFrom) and fgfArmed)
    // a new signal: leave the previous signal's drawings where they ended
    fgfLn   := na
    fgfLbl  := na
    fgfFrom := bar_index
if fgfShowLv and fgfOn and fgfOpen and not na(fgfLevel) and not na(fgfFrom)
    int   fgfX1  = math.max(fgfFrom, bar_index - 9000)
    color fgfCol = fgfSigDir > 0 ? color.lime : color.red
    line.delete(fgfLn)
    fgfLn := line.new(fgfX1, fgfLevel, bar_index, fgfLevel, color=fgfCol, width=2, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
    if na(fgfLbl)
        string fgfLastTxt = fgfLast == "Minutes" ? str.tostring(fgfMinutes) + " min" : fgfLast == "Candles" ? str.tostring(fgfBars) + (fgfBars == 1 ? " candle " : " candles ") + fgfTfTag : "until next signal"
        string fgfTxt     = (fgfSigDir > 0 ? "BUY" : "SELL") + " signal " + fgfTfTag + " @ " + str.tostring(fgfLevel, format.mintick) + "\n" + fgfLastTxt
        fgfLbl := label.new(fgfX1, fgfLevel, fgfTxt, style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(fgfCol, 20), textcolor=color.black, size=size.small, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)

// The permission as the status box and the zone names show it: Tick + Minutes
// also ends it by the real clock (the gates, shading and outputs keep the
// candle's clock, see TIMING).
bool fgfDOpen = fgfOpen and not (fgfCheck == "Tick" and fgfLast == "Minutes" and timenow >= fgfEnd)

// The edge of a zone as text: with a band, the band edge (the last NO TRADE
// tick); with no band, the level rounded to the last tick that is not
// allowed, or on the signal candle the first tick that is (">=" / "<=").
fgfEdgeTx(bool up) =>
    bool  incl = fgfBand == 0 and fgfOnSigBar and (up ? fgfSigDir > 0 : fgfSigDir < 0)
    float edge = up ? fgfUpLv : fgfDnLv
    float k    = edge / fgfMt
    float tk   = fgfBand > 0 ? edge : (up != incl ? math.floor(k + 1e-9) : math.ceil(k - 1e-9)) * fgfMt
    (up ? (incl ? ">= " : "> ") : (incl ? "<= " : "< ")) + str.tostring(tk, format.mintick)

// The band's edges (dashed) and the zone names at the last candle.
var line  fgfLnUp = na
var line  fgfLnDn = na
var label fgfZUp  = na
var label fgfZDn  = na
var label fgfZMid = na
if fgfNewSig
    fgfLnUp := na
    fgfLnDn := na
if fgfShowLv and fgfOn and fgfOpen and not na(fgfLevel) and not na(fgfFrom) and fgfBand > 0
    int fgfX2 = math.max(fgfFrom, bar_index - 9000)
    line.delete(fgfLnUp)
    line.delete(fgfLnDn)
    fgfLnUp := line.new(fgfX2, fgfUpLv, bar_index, fgfUpLv, color=color.new(color.lime, 40), style=line.style_dashed, width=1, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
    fgfLnDn := line.new(fgfX2, fgfDnLv, bar_index, fgfDnLv, color=color.new(color.red, 40), style=line.style_dashed, width=1, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
if barstate.islast
    label.delete(fgfZUp)
    label.delete(fgfZDn)
    label.delete(fgfZMid)
    if fgfShowLv and fgfOn and fgfDOpen and not na(fgfLevel)
        bool upAllowed = fgfAllowBuy and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir > 0)
        bool dnAllowed = fgfAllowSell and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir < 0)
        fgfZUp  := label.new(bar_index + 3, fgfUpLv, (upAllowed ? "BUY ZONE " : "NO TRADE ") + fgfEdgeTx(true), style=label.style_label_lower_left, color=color.new(upAllowed ? color.lime : color.gray, 30), textcolor=color.black, size=size.small, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
        fgfZDn  := label.new(bar_index + 3, fgfDnLv, (dnAllowed ? "SELL ZONE " : "NO TRADE ") + fgfEdgeTx(false), style=label.style_label_upper_left, color=color.new(dnAllowed ? color.red : color.gray, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=size.small, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)
        if fgfBand > 0
            fgfZMid := label.new(bar_index + 3, fgfLevel, "NO TRADE (band)", style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(color.gray, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)

// Status box (display only; the gates never use it). Judged like the gates,
// at the bar's clock; Tick + Minutes also ends it by the real clock.
var table fgfTable = table.new(fgfPosOf(fgfTblPos), 2, 14, bgcolor=color.new(color.black, 20), border_width=1, force_overlay=FGF_FORCE_OVERLAY)

// the BTC/USD reference scores (out of sample 2025-07 .. 2026-10) of the filter timeframe's bucket
fgsRefTxt(int sec) =>
    int m = math.round(sec / 60.0)
    if m >= 1 and m <= 2
        "1m: level 50/50  signal 50/49  reversed 50/51"
    else if m >= 3 and m <= 10
        "5m: level 51/51  signal 49/49  reversed 51/51"
    else if m >= 11 and m <= 22
        "15m: level 51/51  signal 48/48  reversed 52/52"
    else if m >= 23 and m <= 45
        "30m: level 51/52  signal 49/48  reversed 51/52"
    else if m >= 46 and m <= 90
        "1H: level 50/49  signal 48/50  reversed 52/50"
    else if m >= 91 and m <= 180
        "2H: level 49/52  signal 49/48  reversed 51/52"
    else if m >= 181 and m <= 360
        "4H: level 49/53  signal 49/48  reversed 51/52"
    else if m >= 361 and m <= 720
        "8H: level 51/48  signal 48/51  reversed 52/49"
    else if m >= 1080 and m <= 2880
        "1D: level 49/57  signal 53/43  reversed 47/57"
    else
        "-"

fgsPct(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "-" : str.tostring(v * 100, "#") + "%"
if fgfShowTbl and fgfOn and barstate.islast
    bool   dOpen  = fgfDOpen
    bool   dBuy   = dOpen and fgfAllowBuy  and fgfUpNow
    bool   dSell  = dOpen and fgfAllowSell and fgfDnNow
    string dSide  = fgfSigDir > 0 ? "BUY" : "SELL"
    string dDo    = fgfSigDir > 0 ? "buy" : "sell"
    // what may be done now, and why not when nothing may
    string dWhy   = not fgfArmed ? "waiting for a signal" : not dOpen ? "permission ended" : not (fgfInUp or fgfInDn) ? "price at the level (band)" : fgfInUp and not fgfAgainst and fgfSigDir < 0 ? "above a SELL signal (against it)" : fgfInDn and not fgfAgainst and fgfSigDir > 0 ? "below a BUY signal (against it)" : "that side is switched off"
    string dState = dBuy ? "BUY ZONE - buys allowed, no sells" : dSell ? "SELL ZONE - sells allowed, no buys" : "NO TRADE - " + dWhy
    color  dCol   = dBuy ? color.lime : dSell ? color.red : color.orange
    bool   dConf  = dOpen and fgfSigOk
    bool   dSideOn = fgfSigDir > 0 ? fgfAllowBuy : fgfAllowSell
    string dSigTx = not fgfArmed ? "-" : not dOpen ? "- (permission ended)" : dConf ? (dSideOn ? "CONFIRMED - " + dDo + "s allowed" : "CONFIRMED - but " + dDo + "s are switched off") : "NOT CONFIRMED - do not " + dDo
    int    dSecs  = dOpen and not na(fgfEnd) ? math.max(0, math.floor((fgfEnd - (fgfCheck == "Tick" ? timenow : fgfClock)) / 1000.0)) : 0
    string dLeft  = not dOpen ? "-" : fgfLast == "Minutes" ? str.tostring(math.floor(dSecs / 60), "00") + ":" + str.tostring(dSecs % 60, "00") : fgfLast == "Candles" ? str.tostring(fgfEndBar - fgfIdx) + (fgfEndBar - fgfIdx == 1 ? " candle " : " candles ") + fgfTfTag : "until next signal"
    string dSig   = na(fgfSigAt) ? "-" : dSide + " " + str.format_time(fgfSigAt, "MMM dd HH:mm", syminfo.timezone) + " @ " + (na(fgfLevel) ? "-" : str.tostring(fgfLevel, format.mintick))
    string dPar   = na(fgfPar) ? "-" : fgfPar > 0 ? "BUY" : fgfPar < 0 ? "SELL" : "FLAT"
    string dZones = na(fgfAc) ? "-" : str.tostring(fgfAl) + "/" + str.tostring(fgfAc)
    string dUp    = na(fgfLevel) ? "-" : fgfEdgeTx(true)
    string dDn    = na(fgfLevel) ? "-" : fgfEdgeTx(false)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 0, "FG filter " + fgfTfTag, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 0, dState, text_color=dCol)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 1, "Signal (exch tz)", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 1, dSig, text_color=fgfSigDir > 0 ? color.lime : fgfSigDir < 0 ? color.red : color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 2, "Signal direction", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 2, dSigTx, text_color=not fgfArmed ? color.white : dConf and dSideOn ? (fgfSigDir > 0 ? color.lime : color.red) : color.orange)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 3, "BUY ZONE  " + dUp, text_color=color.white)
    bool   dUpOk  = dOpen and fgfAllowBuy and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir > 0)
    bool   dDnOk  = dOpen and fgfAllowSell and (fgfAgainst or fgfSigDir < 0)
    string dOff   = not fgfArmed ? "NO TRADE (no signal yet)" : not dOpen ? "NO TRADE (permission ended)" : "NO TRADE there"
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 3, dBuy ? "ALLOWED (now)" : dUpOk ? "allowed there" : dOff, text_color=dBuy ? color.lime : dUpOk ? color.gray : color.orange)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 4, "SELL ZONE " + dDn, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 4, dSell ? "ALLOWED (now)" : dDnOk ? "allowed there" : dOff, text_color=dSell ? color.red : dDnOk ? color.gray : color.orange)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 5, "NO TRADE band", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 5, na(fgfLevel) ? "-" : fgfBand > 0 ? str.tostring(fgfDnLv, format.mintick) + " - " + str.tostring(fgfUpLv, format.mintick) : fgfBandAtr > 0 and fgfArmed and na(fgfSigAtr) ? "off (no ATR yet at the signal)" : "off", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 6, fgfCheck == "Candle open" ? "Candle open" : fgfCheck == "Candle close" ? "Last close" : "Price now", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 6, na(fgfValue) ? "-" : str.tostring(fgfValue, format.mintick), text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 7, "Left", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 7, dLeft, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 8, "Last " + fgfTfTag + " parent / zones", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 8, dPar + " / " + dZones + " aligned", text_color=dPar == "BUY" ? color.lime : dPar == "SELL" ? color.red : color.white)
    if fgsShow
        string hTxt = "next 1 / " + str.tostring(fgsH) + " " + fgfTfTag
        string wTxt = fgsWin > 0 ? "last " + str.tostring(fgsWin) : "all"
        table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 9, "Direction score (" + wTxt + ", " + (na(fgsN) ? "-" : str.tostring(fgsN, "#")) + " level-side calls)", text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 9, hTxt + "  (50% = coin flip)", text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 10, "Level side (bare level)", text_color=color.aqua)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 10, fgsPct(fgsL1) + " / " + fgsPct(fgsLh), text_color=color.aqua)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 11, "Signal direction", text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 11, fgsPct(fgsS1) + " / " + fgsPct(fgsSh), text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 12, "Signal reversed", text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 12, fgsPct(fgsR1) + " / " + fgsPct(fgsRh), text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 0, 13, "BTC 2025-26 (1/10), parent = TF, zones x1/2/4", text_color=color.gray)
        table.cell(fgfTable, 1, 13, fgsRefTxt(fgfTfSec), text_color=color.gray)
// ====================== END FLASHGOLD DIRECTION FILTER =======================

//==============================================================================
// Calculations
//==============================================================================
atr_value = ta.atr(14)

f_vovix_source() =>
    (ta.atr(fastVoVixLen) - ta.atr(slowVoVixLen)) / (ta.stdev(ta.atr(fastVoVixLen), devLen) + 1e-6)

f_clamp(_value, _min, _max) =>
    math.max(_min, math.min(_max, _value))

f_vol_score() =>
    fastAtr = ta.atr(fastVoVixLen)
    slowAtr = ta.atr(slowVoVixLen)
    atrRatio = slowAtr > 0 ? fastAtr / slowAtr : 1.0
    f_clamp((atrRatio - 0.50) / 1.50 * 100.0, 0.0, 100.0)

f_auto_radar_tf() =>
    chartSec = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.period)
    chartSec >= 86400 ? "60" : chartSec >= 14400 ? "15" : chartSec >= 3600 ? "5" : chartSec >= 1800 ? "3" : chartSec >= 900 ? "1" : timeframe.period

f_ema_slope(_len) =>
    emaNow = ta.ema(close, _len)
    emaNow - nz(emaNow[1], emaNow)

f_rvol(_len) =>
    avgVol = ta.sma(volume, _len)
    na(volume) or na(avgVol) or avgVol <= 0 ? 1.0 : volume / avgVol

f_body_atr() =>
    atrNow = ta.atr(14)
    atrNow > 0 ? math.abs(close - open) / atrNow : 0.0

f_break_long(_lookback) =>
    close > ta.highest(high[1], _lookback)

f_break_short(_lookback) =>
    close < ta.lowest(low[1], _lookback)

src = f_vovix_source()
dev = ta.stdev(src, devLen)
fastDEVMA = ta.sma(dev, fastVoVixLen)
slowDEVMA = ta.sma(dev, slowVoVixLen)
expansion_regime = (fastDEVMA > slowDEVMA) or ta.rising(fastDEVMA, 2)

fastEma = ta.ema(close, fastEmaLen)
slowEma = ta.ema(close, slowEmaLen)
trendEma = ta.ema(close, trendFilterLen)

rsiVal = ta.rsi(close, rsiLen)
rsiLongCondition = not useRsiFilter or rsiVal < rsiOverbought
rsiShortCondition = not useRsiFilter or rsiVal > rsiOversold

bullCross = ta.crossover(fastEma, slowEma)
bearCross = ta.crossunder(fastEma, slowEma)
upTrend = close > trendEma
downTrend = close < trendEma

chartSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.period)
autoRadarTimeframe = f_auto_radar_tf()
radarTimeframe = radarTimeframeMode == "Auto" ? autoRadarTimeframe : radarTimeframeMode == "Chart" ? timeframe.period : radarTimeframeMode
radarSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(radarTimeframe)
useRadarTimeframe = radarTimeframe != timeframe.period and radarSeconds < chartSeconds

radarVolRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_vol_score(), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
radarSlopeRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_ema_slope(fastEmaLen), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
radarRvolRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_rvol(preRvolLength), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
radarBodyAtrRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_body_atr(), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
radarBreakLongRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_break_long(preBreakoutLookback), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
radarBreakShortRaw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, radarTimeframe, f_break_short(preBreakoutLookback), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)

radarVolScore = useRadarTimeframe ? radarVolRaw : f_vol_score()
radarSlope = useRadarTimeframe ? radarSlopeRaw : f_ema_slope(fastEmaLen)
radarRvol = useRadarTimeframe ? radarRvolRaw : f_rvol(preRvolLength)
radarBodyAtr = useRadarTimeframe ? radarBodyAtrRaw : f_body_atr()
radarBreakLong = useRadarTimeframe ? radarBreakLongRaw : f_break_long(preBreakoutLookback)
radarBreakShort = useRadarTimeframe ? radarBreakShortRaw : f_break_short(preBreakoutLookback)
radarVolRise = radarVolScore - nz(radarVolScore[1], radarVolScore)

barRange = high - low
closeLocation = barRange > 0 ? (close - low) / barRange : 0.50

preVolOk = radarVolScore >= preMinVolScore and radarVolRise >= preMinVolRise
preRvolOk = not preUseRvol or radarRvol >= preMinRvol
preBodyOk = not preUseBodyAtr or radarBodyAtr >= preMinBodyAtr
preLongTrendOk = not preUseTrend or upTrend
preShortTrendOk = not preUseTrend or downTrend
preLongSlopeOk = not preUseEmaSlope or radarSlope > 0
preShortSlopeOk = not preUseEmaSlope or radarSlope < 0
preLongPressureOk = closeLocation >= preCloseLocation
preShortPressureOk = closeLocation <= 1.0 - preCloseLocation
preLongBreakOk = not preUseMicroBreak or radarBreakLong
preShortBreakOk = not preUseMicroBreak or radarBreakShort

preLongScore = (preVolOk ? 25 : 0) + (preLongTrendOk ? 20 : 0) + (preLongSlopeOk ? 15 : 0) + (preRvolOk ? 10 : 0) + (preBodyOk ? 10 : 0) + (preLongPressureOk ? 10 : 0) + (preLongBreakOk ? 10 : 0)
preShortScore = (preVolOk ? 25 : 0) + (preShortTrendOk ? 20 : 0) + (preShortSlopeOk ? 15 : 0) + (preRvolOk ? 10 : 0) + (preBodyOk ? 10 : 0) + (preShortPressureOk ? 10 : 0) + (preShortBreakOk ? 10 : 0)
preLongArm = usePreCandleArm and barstate.isconfirmed and preVolOk and preLongTrendOk and preLongSlopeOk and preRvolOk and preBodyOk and preLongPressureOk and preLongBreakOk and preLongScore >= preMinScore
preShortArm = usePreCandleArm and barstate.isconfirmed and preVolOk and preShortTrendOk and preShortSlopeOk and preRvolOk and preBodyOk and preShortPressureOk and preShortBreakOk and preShortScore >= preMinScore
preLongBlocker = not preVolOk ? "VOL" : not preLongTrendOk ? "TREND" : not preLongSlopeOk ? "SLOPE" : not preRvolOk ? "RVOL" : not preBodyOk ? "BODY" : not preLongPressureOk ? "PRESS" : not preLongBreakOk ? "BREAK" : preLongScore < preMinScore ? "SCORE" : "READY"
preShortBlocker = not preVolOk ? "VOL" : not preShortTrendOk ? "TREND" : not preShortSlopeOk ? "SLOPE" : not preRvolOk ? "RVOL" : not preBodyOk ? "BODY" : not preShortPressureOk ? "PRESS" : not preShortBreakOk ? "BREAK" : preShortScore < preMinScore ? "SCORE" : "READY"

longCondition = bullCross and upTrend and expansion_regime and rsiLongCondition
shortCondition = bearCross and downTrend and expansion_regime and rsiShortCondition

signalBody = close - open
signalBodyAbs = math.abs(signalBody)
signalUpperWick = barRange > 0 ? high - math.max(open, close) : na
signalLowerWick = barRange > 0 ? math.min(open, close) - low : na
signalBodyPct = barRange > 0 ? signalBodyAbs / barRange : na
signalDirection = close > open ? 1.0 : close < open ? -1.0 : 0.0
signalEmaSpread = fastEma - slowEma
signalTrendDistance = close - trendEma

previousRange = high[1] - low[1]
previousBody = close[1] - open[1]
previousBodyAbs = math.abs(previousBody)
previousUpperWick = previousRange > 0 ? high[1] - math.max(open[1], close[1]) : na
previousLowerWick = previousRange > 0 ? math.min(open[1], close[1]) - low[1] : na
previousBodyPct = previousRange > 0 ? previousBodyAbs / previousRange : na
previousCloseLocation = previousRange > 0 ? (close[1] - low[1]) / previousRange : na
previousDirection = close[1] > open[1] ? 1.0 : close[1] < open[1] ? -1.0 : 0.0
previousEmaSpread = fastEma[1] - slowEma[1]
previousTrendDistance = close[1] - trendEma[1]

custom_entry_session_active = not na(time(timeframe.period, entry_session, "America/New_York"))
morning_entry_session_active = not na(time(timeframe.period, morning_entry_session, "America/New_York"))
flat_session_active = not na(time(timeframe.period, flat_session, "America/New_York"))
ny_day_of_week = dayofweek(time, "America/New_York")
is_weekday = ny_day_of_week != dayofweek.saturday and ny_day_of_week != dayofweek.sunday
ny_hhmm = hour(time, "America/New_York") * 100 + minute(time, "America/New_York")

entry_session_active = switch tradePreset
    "Conservative AM" => morning_entry_session_active
    => custom_entry_session_active

polyWindowMs = 5 * 60 * 1000
polyWindowStartMs = time - (time % polyWindowMs)
secondsFromPolyWindowStart = int((time - polyWindowStartMs) / 1000)
poly_window_time_ok = secondsFromPolyWindowStart <= maxSignalSecondsAfterWindowStart

var int lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs = na
var int lastPreStopOrderBar = na
one_signal_window_ok = not oneSignalPerPolyWindow or na(lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs) or polyWindowStartMs != lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs

timeframe_ok = allowAnyChartTimeframe or timeframe.period == requiredSignalTimeframe
weekday_ok = allowWeekendEntries or is_weekday
entry_window_ok = not useSessionFilter or entry_session_active
flat_window_ok = not useSessionFilter or flat_session_active

balanced_weak_entry_bar = useSessionFilter and tradePreset == "Balanced" and (ny_hhmm == 1245 or ny_hhmm == 1345 or ny_hhmm == 1400 or ny_hhmm == 1500)

pointValue = switch brokerPreset
    "Crypto 1 USD per qty" => 1.0
    => manualPointValue

f_json_num(float _value) =>
    na(_value) ? "null" : str.tostring(_value)

f_json_int(int _value) =>
    na(_value) ? "null" : str.tostring(_value)

f_json_bool(bool _value) =>
    _value ? "true" : "false"

f_training_json(string _action, string _side, string _reason) =>
    plannedOrderPrice = _action == "entry" ? (_reason == "pre_candle_stop" ? (_side == "long" ? high + atr_value * preStopAtrBuffer : low - atr_value * preStopAtrBuffer) : close) : na
    entryKind = _reason == "pre_candle_open" ? 1 : _reason == "pre_candle_stop" ? 2 : _reason == "signal" ? 3 : 0
    collectTrainingData and includeTrainingDataInAlerts and _action == "entry" ? ",\"training\":{" +
     "\"trade_number\":" + str.tostring(strategy.closedtrades + 1) + "," +
     "\"entry_kind\":" + str.tostring(entryKind) + "," +
     "\"planned_order_price\":" + f_json_num(plannedOrderPrice) + "," +
     "\"entry_side_value\":" + (_side == "long" ? "1" : _side == "short" ? "-1" : "0") + "," +
     "\"radar_timeframe\":\"" + radarTimeframe + "\"," +
     "\"signal_candle\":{" +
     "\"time\":" + f_json_int(time) + "," +
     "\"open\":" + f_json_num(open) + "," +
     "\"high\":" + f_json_num(high) + "," +
     "\"low\":" + f_json_num(low) + "," +
     "\"close\":" + f_json_num(close) + "," +
     "\"volume\":" + f_json_num(volume) + "," +
     "\"range\":" + f_json_num(barRange) + "," +
     "\"body\":" + f_json_num(signalBody) + "," +
     "\"body_abs\":" + f_json_num(signalBodyAbs) + "," +
     "\"body_pct\":" + f_json_num(signalBodyPct) + "," +
     "\"upper_wick\":" + f_json_num(signalUpperWick) + "," +
     "\"lower_wick\":" + f_json_num(signalLowerWick) + "," +
     "\"close_location\":" + f_json_num(closeLocation) + "," +
     "\"direction\":" + f_json_num(signalDirection) +
     "}," +
     "\"previous_candle\":{" +
     "\"time\":" + f_json_int(time[1]) + "," +
     "\"open\":" + f_json_num(open[1]) + "," +
     "\"high\":" + f_json_num(high[1]) + "," +
     "\"low\":" + f_json_num(low[1]) + "," +
     "\"close\":" + f_json_num(close[1]) + "," +
     "\"volume\":" + f_json_num(volume[1]) + "," +
     "\"range\":" + f_json_num(previousRange) + "," +
     "\"body\":" + f_json_num(previousBody) + "," +
     "\"body_abs\":" + f_json_num(previousBodyAbs) + "," +
     "\"body_pct\":" + f_json_num(previousBodyPct) + "," +
     "\"upper_wick\":" + f_json_num(previousUpperWick) + "," +
     "\"lower_wick\":" + f_json_num(previousLowerWick) + "," +
     "\"close_location\":" + f_json_num(previousCloseLocation) + "," +
     "\"direction\":" + f_json_num(previousDirection) +
     "}," +
     "\"context\":{" +
     "\"atr\":" + f_json_num(atr_value) + "," +
     "\"rsi\":" + f_json_num(rsiVal) + "," +
     "\"ema_spread\":" + f_json_num(signalEmaSpread) + "," +
     "\"trend_distance\":" + f_json_num(signalTrendDistance) + "," +
     "\"prev_atr\":" + f_json_num(atr_value[1]) + "," +
     "\"prev_rsi\":" + f_json_num(rsiVal[1]) + "," +
     "\"prev_ema_spread\":" + f_json_num(previousEmaSpread) + "," +
     "\"prev_trend_distance\":" + f_json_num(previousTrendDistance) + "," +
     "\"pre_long_score\":" + str.tostring(preLongScore) + "," +
     "\"pre_short_score\":" + str.tostring(preShortScore) + "," +
     "\"pre_long_blocker\":\"" + preLongBlocker + "\"," +
     "\"pre_short_blocker\":\"" + preShortBlocker + "\"," +
     "\"radar_vol_score\":" + f_json_num(radarVolScore) + "," +
     "\"radar_vol_rise\":" + f_json_num(radarVolRise) + "," +
     "\"radar_rvol\":" + f_json_num(radarRvol) + "," +
     "\"radar_body_atr\":" + f_json_num(radarBodyAtr) + "," +
     "\"long_condition\":" + f_json_bool(longCondition) + "," +
     "\"short_condition\":" + f_json_bool(shortCondition) + "," +
     "\"pre_long_arm\":" + f_json_bool(preLongArm) + "," +
     "\"pre_short_arm\":" + f_json_bool(preShortArm) + "," +
     "\"entry_allowed\":true" +
     "}}}" : ""

f_training_label(float _direction, string _reason, float _plannedPrice) =>
    sideText = _direction > 0 ? "LONG" : "SHORT"
    sideText + " " + _reason + "\n" +
     "plan " + str.tostring(_plannedPrice, "#.##") + " | signal C " + str.tostring(close, "#.##") + "\n" +
     "body% " + str.tostring(signalBodyPct, "#.##") + " | closeLoc " + str.tostring(closeLocation, "#.##") + "\n" +
     "RSI " + str.tostring(rsiVal, "#.##") + " | ATR " + str.tostring(atr_value, "#.##") + "\n" +
     "L/S " + str.tostring(preLongScore) + "/" + str.tostring(preShortScore)

f_alert_message(string _action, string _side, string _reason, float _qty, float _stop, float _limit) =>
    "{" +
     "\"strategy\":\"" + routerStrategyName + "\"," +
     "\"router_profile\":\"polymarket_crypto_any_chart_precandle\"," +
     "\"series_slug\":\"" + seriesSlug + "\"," +
     "\"ticker\":\"" + syminfo.tickerid + "\"," +
     "\"timeframe\":\"" + routerTimeframe + "\"," +
     "\"source_timeframe\":\"" + timeframe.period + "\"," +
     "\"required_timeframe\":\"" + requiredSignalTimeframe + "\"," +
     "\"signal_timeframe\":\"" + requiredSignalTimeframe + "\"," +
     "\"action\":\"" + _action + "\"," +
     "\"side\":\"" + _side + "\"," +
     "\"reason\":\"" + _reason + "\"," +
     "\"stake_usd\":" + f_json_num(paperStakeUsd) + "," +
     "\"qty\":" + f_json_num(_qty) + "," +
     "\"price\":" + f_json_num(close) + "," +
     "\"stop\":" + f_json_num(_stop) + "," +
     "\"limit\":" + f_json_num(_limit) + "," +
     "\"point_value\":" + f_json_num(pointValue) + "," +
     "\"risk_percent\":" + f_json_num(riskPercent) + "," +
     "\"max_bars_in_trade\":" + str.tostring(maxBarsInTrade) + "," +
     "\"max_live_spread_points\":" + f_json_num(maxLiveSpreadPoints) + "," +
     "\"trade_preset\":\"" + tradePreset + "\"," +
     "\"seconds_from_poly_window_start\":" + str.tostring(secondsFromPolyWindowStart) + "," +
     "\"poly_window_start_ms\":" + str.tostring(polyWindowStartMs) + "," +
     "\"bar_time\":" + str.tostring(time) +
     f_training_json(_action, _side, _reason) +
     "}"

f_round_down_to_step(_qty, _step) =>
    _step > 0 ? math.floor(_qty / _step) * _step : _qty

f_get_qty(_stop_distance) =>
    float q = fixedQty
    if QtyMode == "Risk %"
        stopCash = _stop_distance * pointValue
        q := stopCash > 0 ? strategy.equity * riskPct / 100.0 / stopCash : 0.0
    q := math.min(q, maxQty)
    if capMargin and marginPct > 0
        q := math.min(q, strategy.equity / (close * pointValue * marginPct / 100.0))
    f_round_down_to_step(q + 1e-9 * qtyStep, qtyStep)

//==============================================================================
// Daily Risk Lock
//==============================================================================
ny_day_key = year(time, "America/New_York") * 10000 + month(time, "America/New_York") * 100 + dayofmonth(time, "America/New_York")

var int activeDayKey = na
var float dayStartEquity = na
var int dayLossCount = 0
var int lastClosedTrades = 0
var bool dailyLocked = false

is_new_day = na(activeDayKey) or ny_day_key != activeDayKey
if is_new_day
    activeDayKey := ny_day_key
    dayStartEquity := strategy.equity
    dayLossCount := 0
    dailyLocked := false

if strategy.closedtrades > lastClosedTrades
    last_trade_index = strategy.closedtrades - 1
    last_trade_profit = strategy.closedtrades.profit(last_trade_index)
    if last_trade_profit < 0
        dayLossCount += 1
    lastClosedTrades := strategy.closedtrades

dayPnL = strategy.equity - dayStartEquity
dailyLossHit = useDailyLossLock and maxDailyLossCurrency > 0 and dayPnL <= -maxDailyLossCurrency
dailyLossCountHit = useDailyLossLock and dayLossCount >= maxDailyLosses

if (dailyLossHit or dailyLossCountHit) and not dailyLocked
    dailyLocked := true

//==============================================================================
// Trade Entry And Exit
//==============================================================================
// S2 exit geometry, in ticks for strategy.exit (loss / profit / trail are
// measured from the fill price).
exitTick = syminfo.mintick
exitAtr = ta.atr(atrLen)
slTicks = ExitMode == "Points" ? slPoints : nz(slAtrMult * exitAtr / exitTick)
tpTicks = ExitMode == "Points" ? tpPoints : slTicks * tpR
trActTicks = ExitMode == "Points" ? trailActPoints : nz(trailActAtr * exitAtr / exitTick)
trDstTicks = math.max(ExitMode == "Points" ? trailPoints : nz(trailDstAtr * exitAtr / exitTick), 1.0)
exitLoss = slTicks > 0 ? slTicks : na
exitProfit = tpTicks > 0 ? tpTicks : na
stop_distance = slTicks * exitTick
profit_distance = tpTicks * exitTick
entry_qty = f_get_qty(stop_distance)
stop_distance_ok = not useMaxStopDistance or stop_distance <= maxStopDistancePoints

can_enter = strategy.position_size == 0 and timeframe_ok and poly_window_time_ok and one_signal_window_ok and entry_window_ok and weekday_ok and not dailyLocked and not balanced_weak_entry_bar and stop_distance_ok and entry_qty > 0

preLongStopPrice = high + atr_value * preStopAtrBuffer
preShortStopPrice = low - atr_value * preStopAtrBuffer
preCanOrder = preCandleEntryMode != "Signal Only"
preLongEntryArm = preLongArm and preLongScore >= preShortScore
preShortEntryArm = preShortArm and preShortScore > preLongScore
bool preOrderThisBar = false
bool trainingEntrySignal = false
float trainingEntryDirection = na
float trainingEntryKind = na
float trainingPlannedOrderPrice = na
float trainingEntryNumber = na
string trainingEntryReason = ""

if preCanOrder and preLongEntryArm and can_enter and fgfBuyOk
    expected_entry = preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? preLongStopPrice : close
    stop_loss = expected_entry - stop_distance
    take_profit = expected_entry + profit_distance
    if preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle"
        strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long, qty=entry_qty, stop=preLongStopPrice, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "long", "pre_candle_stop", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
        lastPreStopOrderBar := bar_index
    else
        strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long, qty=entry_qty, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "long", "pre_candle_open", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
        lastPreStopOrderBar := na
    lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs := polyWindowStartMs
    preOrderThisBar := true
    trainingEntrySignal := collectTrainingData
    trainingEntryDirection := 1.0
    trainingEntryKind := preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? 2.0 : 1.0
    trainingPlannedOrderPrice := expected_entry
    trainingEntryNumber := strategy.closedtrades + 1
    trainingEntryReason := preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? "pre_candle_stop" : "pre_candle_open"
    if useTrail
        strategy.exit("Exit Long", "Long", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, trail_points=trActTicks, trail_offset=trDstTicks, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "long", "pre_candle_atr_stop_target_or_trail", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    else
        strategy.exit("Exit Long", "Long", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "long", "pre_candle_atr_stop_or_target", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

if preCanOrder and preShortEntryArm and can_enter and not preOrderThisBar and fgfSellOk
    expected_entry = preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? preShortStopPrice : close
    stop_loss = expected_entry + stop_distance
    take_profit = expected_entry - profit_distance
    if preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle"
        strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short, qty=entry_qty, stop=preShortStopPrice, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "short", "pre_candle_stop", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
        lastPreStopOrderBar := bar_index
    else
        strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short, qty=entry_qty, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "short", "pre_candle_open", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
        lastPreStopOrderBar := na
    lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs := polyWindowStartMs
    preOrderThisBar := true
    trainingEntrySignal := collectTrainingData
    trainingEntryDirection := -1.0
    trainingEntryKind := preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? 2.0 : 1.0
    trainingPlannedOrderPrice := expected_entry
    trainingEntryNumber := strategy.closedtrades + 1
    trainingEntryReason := preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" ? "pre_candle_stop" : "pre_candle_open"
    if useTrail
        strategy.exit("Exit Short", "Short", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, trail_points=trActTicks, trail_offset=trDstTicks, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "short", "pre_candle_atr_stop_target_or_trail", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    else
        strategy.exit("Exit Short", "Short", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "short", "pre_candle_atr_stop_or_target", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

if preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" and strategy.position_size == 0 and not na(lastPreStopOrderBar) and bar_index - lastPreStopOrderBar > preCancelAfterBars
    strategy.cancel("Long")
    strategy.cancel("Short")
    lastPreStopOrderBar := na

if longCondition and can_enter and not preOrderThisBar and fgfBuyOk
    stop_loss = close - stop_distance
    take_profit = close + profit_distance
    strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long, qty=entry_qty, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "long", "signal", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
    lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs := polyWindowStartMs
    trainingEntrySignal := collectTrainingData
    trainingEntryDirection := 1.0
    trainingEntryKind := 3.0
    trainingPlannedOrderPrice := close
    trainingEntryNumber := strategy.closedtrades + 1
    trainingEntryReason := "signal"
    if useTrail
        strategy.exit("Exit Long", "Long", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, trail_points=trActTicks, trail_offset=trDstTicks, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "long", "atr_stop_target_or_trail", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    else
        strategy.exit("Exit Long", "Long", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "long", "atr_stop_or_target", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

if shortCondition and can_enter and not preOrderThisBar and fgfSellOk
    stop_loss = close + stop_distance
    take_profit = close - profit_distance
    strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short, qty=entry_qty, alert_message=f_alert_message("entry", "short", "signal", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendEntryAlertsToWebhook)
    lastSignalPolyWindowStartMs := polyWindowStartMs
    trainingEntrySignal := collectTrainingData
    trainingEntryDirection := -1.0
    trainingEntryKind := 3.0
    trainingPlannedOrderPrice := close
    trainingEntryNumber := strategy.closedtrades + 1
    trainingEntryReason := "signal"
    if useTrail
        strategy.exit("Exit Short", "Short", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, trail_points=trActTicks, trail_offset=trDstTicks, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "short", "atr_stop_target_or_trail", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    else
        strategy.exit("Exit Short", "Short", loss=exitLoss, profit=exitProfit, alert_message=f_alert_message("exit", "short", "atr_stop_or_target", entry_qty, stop_loss, take_profit), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

// Track bars in trade. The CSV showed that trades held beyond one bar were net negative.
var int entryBarIndex = na
if strategy.position_size != 0 and strategy.position_size[1] == 0
    entryBarIndex := bar_index
if strategy.position_size == 0
    entryBarIndex := na

barsInTrade = strategy.position_size != 0 and not na(entryBarIndex) ? bar_index - entryBarIndex : na
maxBarsExitHit = useMaxBarsExit and strategy.position_size != 0 and not na(barsInTrade) and barsInTrade >= maxBarsInTrade

if maxBarsExitHit
    if strategy.position_size > 0
        strategy.close("Long", comment="Max Bars Exit", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "long", "max_bars_exit", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    if strategy.position_size < 0
        strategy.close("Short", comment="Max Bars Exit", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "short", "max_bars_exit", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

timeStopHit = maxBarsHeld > 0 and strategy.position_size != 0 and not na(barsInTrade) and barsInTrade >= maxBarsHeld and not maxBarsExitHit
if timeStopHit
    if strategy.position_size > 0
        strategy.close("Long", comment="Time stop", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "long", "time_stop", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    if strategy.position_size < 0
        strategy.close("Short", comment="Time stop", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "short", "time_stop", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

if dailyLocked and strategy.position_size != 0
    if strategy.position_size > 0
        strategy.close("Long", comment="Daily Lock", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "long", "daily_lock", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    if strategy.position_size < 0
        strategy.close("Short", comment="Daily Lock", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "short", "daily_lock", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

if not flat_window_ok and strategy.position_size != 0
    if strategy.position_size > 0
        strategy.close("Long", comment="EOD", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "long", "session_flat", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)
    if strategy.position_size < 0
        strategy.close("Short", comment="EOD", alert_message=f_alert_message("close", "short", "session_flat", math.abs(strategy.position_size), na, na), disable_alert=not sendExitAlertsToWebhook)

//==============================================================================
// Plots
//==============================================================================
plot(fastEma, "Fast EMA", color=color.blue)
plot(slowEma, "Slow EMA", color=color.orange)
plot(trendEma, "Trend EMA", color=color.white, linewidth=2)

plotshape(longCondition and can_enter, title="Long Signal", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.green, size=size.small)
plotshape(shortCondition and can_enter, title="Short Signal", style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.red, size=size.small)
plotshape(preLongArm and can_enter, title="Pre-Candle Long Arm", style=shape.flag, location=location.belowbar, color=color.lime, text="PRE-L", textcolor=color.black, size=size.small)
plotshape(preShortArm and can_enter, title="Pre-Candle Short Arm", style=shape.flag, location=location.abovebar, color=color.red, text="PRE-S", textcolor=color.white, size=size.small)
plot(preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" and preLongArm and can_enter ? preLongStopPrice : na, "Pre Long Stop", color=color.new(color.lime, 35), style=plot.style_circles, linewidth=2)
plot(preCandleEntryMode == "Stop Next Candle" and preShortArm and can_enter ? preShortStopPrice : na, "Pre Short Stop", color=color.new(color.red, 35), style=plot.style_circles, linewidth=2)

var label[] trainingLabels = array.new_label()
if collectTrainingData and showTrainingLabels and trainingEntrySignal
    trainingLabelStyle = trainingEntryDirection > 0 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down
    trainingLabelColor = trainingEntryDirection > 0 ? color.new(color.lime, 10) : color.new(color.red, 10)
    trainingLabelY = trainingEntryDirection > 0 ? low : high
    trainingLabel = label.new(bar_index, trainingLabelY, f_training_label(trainingEntryDirection, trainingEntryReason, trainingPlannedOrderPrice), style=trainingLabelStyle, color=trainingLabelColor, textcolor=color.black, size=size.small)
    array.push(trainingLabels, trainingLabel)
    if array.size(trainingLabels) > trainingLabelHistory
        label.delete(array.shift(trainingLabels))

bgcolor(entry_window_ok and weekday_ok and poly_window_time_ok and one_signal_window_ok and not balanced_weak_entry_bar ? color.new(color.blue, 95) : na, title="Entry Session Background")
bgcolor(balanced_weak_entry_bar ? color.new(color.orange, 88) : na, title="Balanced Block Background")
bgcolor(dailyLocked ? color.new(color.red, 88) : na, title="Daily Lock Background")
bgcolor(not timeframe_ok ? color.new(color.red, 82) : na, title="Wrong Timeframe Background")

var table preDash = table.new(position.bottom_right, 2, 9, bgcolor=color.new(color.black, 20), border_width=1, border_color=color.gray)
if showPreDebug and barstate.islast
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 0, "Chart TF", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 0, timeframe.period, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 1, "Radar TF", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 1, radarTimeframe, text_color=useRadarTimeframe ? color.aqua : color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 2, "TF Lock", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 2, timeframe_ok ? "OK" : "BLOCK", bgcolor=timeframe_ok ? color.new(color.green, 60) : color.new(color.red, 55), text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 3, "Vol Score", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 3, str.tostring(radarVolScore, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(preMinVolScore, "#.##"), text_color=preVolOk ? color.lime : color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 4, "Vol Rise", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 4, str.tostring(radarVolRise, "#.##"), text_color=radarVolRise >= preMinVolRise ? color.lime : color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 5, "Long Pre", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 5, str.tostring(preLongScore) + " " + preLongBlocker, bgcolor=preLongBlocker == "READY" ? color.new(color.green, 55) : color.new(color.red, 65), text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 6, "Short Pre", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 6, str.tostring(preShortScore) + " " + preShortBlocker, bgcolor=preShortBlocker == "READY" ? color.new(color.green, 55) : color.new(color.red, 65), text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 7, "Can Enter", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 7, can_enter ? "YES" : "NO", bgcolor=can_enter ? color.new(color.green, 60) : color.new(color.red, 60), text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 0, 8, "Pre Mode", text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(preDash, 1, 8, usePreCandleArm ? preCandleEntryMode : "OFF", text_color=usePreCandleArm ? color.aqua : color.white)

plot(useMaxBarsExit and strategy.position_size != 0 ? barsInTrade : na, "Bars In Trade", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(secondsFromPolyWindowStart, "Seconds From 5M Window Start", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plotchar(timeframe_ok, "Signal Timeframe OK", "TF", location=location.top, display=display.data_window)
plotchar(poly_window_time_ok, "Polymarket Entry Window OK", "W", location=location.top, display=display.data_window)
plotchar(sendExitAlertsToWebhook, "Exit Alerts Enabled", "E", location=location.top, display=display.data_window)
plot(preLongScore, "Pre Long Score", color=color.lime, display=display.data_window)
plot(preShortScore, "Pre Short Score", color=color.red, display=display.data_window)
plot(radarVolScore, "Radar Vol Score", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)

trainingPlotOk = collectTrainingData and plotTrainingData and trainingEntrySignal
closedTradeThisBar = strategy.closedtrades > nz(strategy.closedtrades[1], 0)
float trainingClosedProfit = na
float trainingClosedBars = na
float trainingClosedWin = na
if collectTrainingData and closedTradeThisBar
    closedTradeIndex = strategy.closedtrades - 1
    trainingClosedProfit := strategy.closedtrades.profit(closedTradeIndex)
    trainingClosedBars := strategy.closedtrades.exit_bar_index(closedTradeIndex) - strategy.closedtrades.entry_bar_index(closedTradeIndex)
    trainingClosedWin := trainingClosedProfit > 0 ? 1.0 : trainingClosedProfit < 0 ? -1.0 : 0.0

plot(trainingPlotOk ? trainingEntryNumber : na, "TD Entry Number", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? trainingEntryDirection : na, "TD Entry Direction", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? trainingEntryKind : na, "TD Entry Kind", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? trainingPlannedOrderPrice : na, "TD Planned Order Price", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? open : na, "TD Signal Open", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? high : na, "TD Signal High", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? low : na, "TD Signal Low", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? close : na, "TD Signal Close", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? volume : na, "TD Signal Volume", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? barRange : na, "TD Signal Range", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalBody : na, "TD Signal Body", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalBodyPct : na, "TD Signal Body Pct", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalUpperWick : na, "TD Signal Upper Wick", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalLowerWick : na, "TD Signal Lower Wick", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? closeLocation : na, "TD Signal Close Location", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalDirection : na, "TD Signal Candle Direction", color=color.white, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? open[1] : na, "TD Previous Open", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? high[1] : na, "TD Previous High", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? low[1] : na, "TD Previous Low", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? close[1] : na, "TD Previous Close", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? volume[1] : na, "TD Previous Volume", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? previousRange : na, "TD Previous Range", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? previousBody : na, "TD Previous Body", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? previousBodyPct : na, "TD Previous Body Pct", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? previousCloseLocation : na, "TD Previous Close Location", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? previousDirection : na, "TD Previous Candle Direction", color=color.gray, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? atr_value : na, "TD ATR", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? rsiVal : na, "TD RSI", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalEmaSpread : na, "TD EMA Spread", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? signalTrendDistance : na, "TD Trend Distance", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? preLongScore : na, "TD Pre Long Score", color=color.lime, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? preShortScore : na, "TD Pre Short Score", color=color.red, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? radarVolScore : na, "TD Radar Vol Score", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? radarVolRise : na, "TD Radar Vol Rise", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? radarRvol : na, "TD Radar RVOL", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(trainingPlotOk ? radarBodyAtr : na, "TD Radar Body ATR", color=color.aqua, display=display.data_window)
plot(collectTrainingData and plotTrainingData and closedTradeThisBar ? strategy.closedtrades : na, "TD Closed Trade Number", color=color.yellow, display=display.data_window)
plot(collectTrainingData and plotTrainingData and closedTradeThisBar ? trainingClosedProfit : na, "TD Closed Profit", color=color.yellow, display=display.data_window)
plot(collectTrainingData and plotTrainingData and closedTradeThisBar ? trainingClosedWin : na, "TD Closed Win", color=color.yellow, display=display.data_window)
plot(collectTrainingData and plotTrainingData and closedTradeThisBar ? trainingClosedBars : na, "TD Closed Bars", color=color.yellow, display=display.data_window)
